  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9fd279076aee8584197749071059d862, type: 3}
  introTitle: Welcome to Poison Garden!
  introBody: 'Your mission is to press SPACE as quickly as possible to collect only
    the card with THREE MUSHROOMS. '
  countdownSeconds: 5
  hasMoxoGame: 1
  startsDialogueOnArrival: 1
  dialogueHandlerType: DragonHandler
  trainingIntroTitle: Welcome to Poison Garden!
  trainingIntroBody: "I\u2019m Velmora, the shaman who seeks rare mushrooms to heal
    these dying lands. I will grant you the gem - but only if you aid me in crafting
    the right cure.\r\n\r\nPress SPACE as quickly as possible to collect only the
    correct potion labeled with THREE MUSHROOMS and stop the spreading disease.\r\n\r\nBe
    careful - every other option is poisonous. Leave them alone and keep your focus
    on the red plus sign.\n\nWhen you\u2019re ready, press SPACE to begin a training
    round.\r"
  readyIntroTitle: Focus
  readyIntroBody: 'Random visual and audio distractions will appear -  ignore them
    and keep your focus on the red plus sign.


    Are you ready? Use the arrow
    keys to choose:

    * Start - Begin the mission

    * Training - Practice again


    Press
    SPACE to confirm. Good luck!'
